# Burnout 3: Takedown (4541005B), RETURNING: a Burnout 3 profile is on the
# disk. DRAFT, not yet played: no run has yet booted Burnout 3 with a profile
# present, so what it asks is inferred from the first-run screens. The
# profile screen offers LOAD PROFILE above NEW PROFILE; with a profile on the
# disk the cursor may already sit on LOAD, so this route flicks UP (harmless
# if it is already there: the menu has two rows) and confirms, then takes the
# first profile. Surveys from there, like burnout3.first-run.route.
wait 20
shot boot20
wait 20
shot boot40
wait 20
mark booted
press START
wait 4
shot language
press A
wait 4
shot select-option
axis LY min
wait 0.3
axis LY mid
wait 1
shot load-profile
press A
wait 4
shot profile-list
press A
wait 8
shot loaded
mark profile-loaded
repeat 8 {
    press A
    wait 5
    shot after-load
}
mark play
repeat forever {
    repeat 2 {
        axis RT max
        press A
        wait 10
        axis RT mid
        wait 1
    }
    shot play
}
